Qwen3.8-Flash-Next on TensorFold v0.6.5: prompt-lookup (copy) drafts ahead of MTP (TENSORFOLD_MTP_COPY=1, off by default;
text that repeats earlier context drafts that continuation, verified like any draft), SSD read-ahead around the n-gram
table, the first token before the next draft, and no unused MTP logits while prompts absorb. Ported from patch
0002-flash-next-v061.patch of the Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-Single-DGX-Spark-TensorFold recipe (against v0.6.1, Apache-2.0, a
modification of TensorFold by the TensorFold contributors). Left out: video/image input, TENSORFOLD_PREFILL_ROWS and the
vision changes (upstream by v0.6.5), the 96 MiB request body.
